    narr:childCount "43"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative traces how a fundraising posture was built across two conversations: an initial ask for [introductions to funders for a bridge round](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102) sits alongside [a parallel low-cost path through outside funding](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_143), while a shortlist of [specific warm contacts](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_171) and [an offer to forward an introduction](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_177) supply the actual names. The core move reframes the raise as [a marketplace rather than a sequence of individual asks](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_191), run as [a staged, time-bound process](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_193): an opening [advice-seeking round](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_195) scripted as [a referral-generating ask](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_197), flipping to [a declarative raise with a hard end date](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199) where [the funder must justify their dollars](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_205). Sequencing discipline runs alongside: [holding the biggest lever until there's ammunition](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_183), figured through [the howitzer metaphor](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_185). A later advisor exchange adds [a pricing and positioning worry](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_2) and [a caution about the wider strategic environment](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_28), pushed against by [a blunt call to just go sell](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_30). It closes on [a committed near-term action](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_222).""" ;
